<title>LATVIA: STABURADZE UNAUDITED '96 PROFIT 200,000 LATS.</title>
<headline>STABURADZE UNAUDITED '96 PROFIT 200,000 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Staburadze confectionery, an official list stock of the Riga stock exchange, said on Tuesday, that its unaudited 1996 profit came to some 200,000 lats against 270,000 lats in 1995.</p>
<p>&quot;Our audited 1996 figures will be available around April 20 but I can say, that our profit for 1996 is approximately 200,000 lats against 270,000 lats in 1995,&quot; Mara Vehcina told Reuters.</p>
<p>She refused to give other figures until the audit, which is carried out by Price Waterhouse, is completed.</p>
<p>Staburadze reported net turnover of 6.16 million lats in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Martinsh Gravitis, Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
